<title>USA: N.Y. cert cotton stocks flat at 91,434 bales.</title>
<headline>N.Y. cert cotton stocks flat at 91,434 bales.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Aug 15 totaled 91,434 bales, unchanged from the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, no decertification orders, and no cancellations. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
